#!/bin/sh
# XLibre/i3 session launcher used by ly. Ly owns the X server lifecycle and
# supplies DISPLAY/XAUTHORITY; this wrapper supplies the desktop environment and
# a session bus for notifications plus the PipeWire/WirePlumber user session.
[ -f /etc/i3-desktop/env ] && . /etc/i3-desktop/env
[ -f /etc/i3-desktop/env.local ] && . /etc/i3-desktop/env.local

if [ -z "${DBUS_SESSION_BUS_ADDRESS:-}" ] && command -v dbus-run-session >/dev/null 2>&1; then
    exec dbus-run-session -- i3 --config /etc/i3/config
fi
exec i3 --config /etc/i3/config
